Create Or Replace View VWINV_Existencias_Al_Cierre
As Select
       T1.DisCve, T2.DisDes, T1.AlmCve, T3.AlmDes, T1.ArtCve,
       T4.ArtDes, T1.AnoUpc, T1.NumUpc,
       T1.CmeCen, T1.CmeCsa, T1.CmeCfi, T1.ArtCpl, T1.ArtCul
  From InvCme T1
  Join SegDis T2
    On (T1.DisCve = T2.DisCve)
  Join InvAlm T3
    On (T1.DisCve = T3.DisCve)
   And (T1.AlmCve = T3.AlmCve)
  Join InvArt T4
    On (T1.ArtCve = T4.ArtCve)
